    "## 1. Setup — three clients, one function\n",
    "\n",
    "### What and why\n",
    "The notebook must find the helper file, read your `.env`, and create one **client** per **provider**. Some of you will have all three providers, some only Groq, some none yet. The setup cell must cope with all of these, say clearly what it found, and let the notebook continue.\n",
    "\n",
